{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标与质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/evaluation-metrics","wordCount":1116,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"评估指标与质量度量\">评估指标与质量度量</h1><p>「合成语音好不好」看似简单的问题，背后是一套复杂的多维度评估体系。不同维度需要不同的指标，主观评分和客观指标各有优劣。理解评估方法论，是比较 TTS 系统、指导模型改进的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>MOS（Mean Opinion Score）</strong>：多名听评者对合成语音打 1-5 分取平均，是评估的「黄金指标」，但成本高、再现性差</li>\n<li><strong>客观指标</strong>：WER / CER 度量可懂度，说话人嵌入余弦相似度度量音色保真，PESQ / UTMOS / DNSMOS 度量音频质量</li>\n<li><strong>相似度判读</strong>：余弦相似度 &gt; 0.85 难以区分，0.75-0.85 同一说话人可识别，&lt; 0.60 可能被认为不同人</li>\n<li><strong>标准基准</strong>：Seed-TTS-Eval 已成零样本 TTS 的事实标准，LibriSpeech test-clean 用于验证人类同等水平</li>\n<li><strong>LLM-as-Judge</strong>：转录后让 LLM 从内容准确性、韵律自然度、情感匹配度多维评判，可规模化但无法直接「听」音频</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"评估维度全景\">评估维度全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[TTS 质量评估] --&gt; B[主观评估&lt;br/&gt;人工听评]&#10;    A --&gt; C[客观评估&lt;br/&gt;自动化指标]&#10;    B --&gt; D[MOS 自然度]&#10;    B --&gt; E[CMOS 对比]&#10;    B --&gt; F[SMOS 相似度]&#10;    C --&gt; H[可懂度 WER/CER]&#10;    C --&gt; I[说话人相似度&lt;br/&gt;Cosine Similarity]&#10;    C --&gt; J[韵律指标&lt;br/&gt;F0 RMSE]&#10;    C --&gt; K[音频质量&lt;br/&gt;PESQ / UTMOS]\">flowchart TD\n    A[TTS 质量评估] --&gt; B[主观评估&lt;br/&gt;人工听评]\n    A --&gt; C[客观评估&lt;br/&gt;自动化指标]\n    B --&gt; D[MOS 自然度]\n    B --&gt; E[CMOS 对比]\n    B --&gt; F[SMOS 相似度]\n    C --&gt; H[可懂度 WER/CER]\n    C --&gt; I[说话人相似度&lt;br/&gt;Cosine Similarity]\n    C --&gt; J[韵律指标&lt;br/&gt;F0 RMSE]\n    C --&gt; K[音频质量&lt;br/&gt;PESQ / UTMOS]</pre><h2 id=\"主观评估-金标准\">主观评估：金标准</h2><p>MOS（Mean Opinion Score）是 TTS 评估的「黄金指标」：多名听评者对合成语音打分（1-5 分），取平均值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>参考水平</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5.0</td>\n<td>优秀，无法与真人区分</td>\n<td>专业播音录音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4.0-4.5</td>\n<td>非常好，偶有轻微不自然</td>\n<td>VALL-E 2 (4.2), 真人朗读 (4.3)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.5-4.0</td>\n<td>好，可接受但有合成痕迹</td>\n<td>VITS, FastSpeech 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.0-3.5</td>\n<td>一般，能听懂但不舒适</td>\n<td>统计参数合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;3.0</td>\n<td>差，明显机器感</td>\n<td>早期拼接合成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MOS 变体包括 NMOS（自然度）、SMOS（相似度）、CMOS（对比评分 -3 到 +3）、MUSHRA（多系统排名）。</p>\n<p>MOS 的陷阱：评估者疲劳导致打分漂移、锚点效应、跨语言不可比、样本选择偏差、再现性差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"客观指标-自动化度量\">客观指标：自动化度量</h2><h3 id=\"可懂度指标\">可懂度指标</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>WER</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{WER} = \\frac{S + D + I}{N} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WER</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>将合成语音送入 ASR 系统（Whisper-large-v3 为标准后端）转录，计算与原文的编辑距离。CER 同理但以字符为单位，适合中文。</p>\n<h3 id=\"说话人相似度\">说话人相似度</h3><p>使用预训练说话人验证模型提取嵌入向量，计算余弦相似度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SIM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mtext>syn</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mtext>syn</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SIM} = \\frac{\\mathbf{e}_{\\text{ref}} \\cdot \\mathbf{e}_{\\text{syn}}}{\\|\\mathbf{e}_{\\text{ref}}\\| \\cdot \\|\\mathbf{e}_{\\text{syn}}\\|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SIM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0936em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1215em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">syn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">syn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相似度范围</th>\n<th>解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt; 0.85</td>\n<td>高度相似，难以区分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.75-0.85</td>\n<td>相似，同一说话人可识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.60-0.75</td>\n<td>中等，能听出差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 0.60</td>\n<td>低，可能被认为是不同人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"音频质量指标\">音频质量指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PESQ</td>\n<td>Perceptual Evaluation of Speech Quality</td>\n<td>-0.5 to 4.5</td>\n<td>电话语音质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>POLQA</td>\n<td>Perceptual Objective Listening Quality</td>\n<td>1.0 to 5.0</td>\n<td>宽带/超宽带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SI-SDR</td>\n<td>Scale-Invariant Signal-to-Distortion Ratio</td>\n<td>dB</td>\n<td>信号失真度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTMOS</td>\n<td>UTokyo-SaruLab MOS Predictor</td>\n<td>1.0 to 5.0</td>\n<td>MOS 自动预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNSMOS</td>\n<td>Deep Noise Suppression MOS</td>\n<td>1.0 to 5.0</td>\n<td>语音质量+噪声评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标准评估基准\">标准评估基准</h2><p><strong>Seed-TTS-Eval（字节）</strong>：中英文多场景测试集，评估 WER、说话人相似度、MOS，已成为事实标准。</p>\n<p><strong>LibriSpeech test-clean</strong>：经典英文评估集，VALL-E 2 的人类同等水平在此验证。</p>\n<p><strong>MiniMax Multilingual Testset</strong>：覆盖多种语言的标准化评估集。</p>\n<p><strong>CosyVoice3-Eval</strong>：中文场景高难度评估集，包含方言、情感、长文本子集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"llm-as-judge-新兴评估范式\">LLM-as-Judge：新兴评估范式</h2><p>2025-2026 年出现用 LLM 作为评估者的新方法（Fish Audio S2 采用）：将合成音频转录后让 LLM 从内容准确性、韵律自然度、情感匹配度多维度评判。优势在于可规模化和可复现，局限是 LLM 无法直接「听」音频。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估方法的选择策略\">评估方法的选择策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐指标组合</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>论文发表</td>\n<td>MOS + WER + SIM + Seed-TTS-Eval</td>\n<td>全面且可对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速迭代</td>\n<td>UTMOS + WER + SIM</td>\n<td>全自动，秒级反馈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品上线</td>\n<td>MOS (小样本) + WER + 用户留存</td>\n<td>主观质量 + 业务指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声音克隆</td>\n<td>SMOS + SIM + CMOS</td>\n<td>聚焦说话人保真度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式系统</td>\n<td>TTFA + RTF + MOS</td>\n<td>延迟与质量的平衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MOS 是金标准但成本高、再现性差</li>\n<li>WER + 说话人余弦相似度是最常用的客观指标组合</li>\n<li>Seed-TTS-Eval 已成为零样本 TTS 的事实标准基准</li>\n<li>UTMOS 等 MOS 预测器使大规模自动评估成为可能</li>\n<li>LLM-as-Judge 是新兴方向，适合评估高层语义属性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"voice-cloning\">声音克隆与定制</a> —— 说话人相似度评估的具体应用场景</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../computer-vision-applied/deployment/model-optimization\">模型优化</a> —— 质量-速度权衡下的评估策略参考</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评估指标与质量度量","id":"评估指标与质量度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"评估维度全景","id":"评估维度全景"},{"level":2,"text":"主观评估：金标准","id":"主观评估-金标准"},{"level":2,"text":"客观指标：自动化度量","id":"客观指标-自动化度量"},{"level":3,"text":"可懂度指标","id":"可懂度指标"},{"level":3,"text":"说话人相似度","id":"说话人相似度"},{"level":3,"text":"音频质量指标","id":"音频质量指标"},{"level":2,"text":"标准评估基准","id":"标准评估基准"},{"level":2,"text":"LLM-as-Judge：新兴评估范式","id":"llm-as-judge-新兴评估范式"},{"level":2,"text":"评估方法的选择策略","id":"评估方法的选择策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"声音克隆与定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/voice-cloning"},"next":{"title":"对话式语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/applications/conversational-tts"}}